{
 "version": 1,
 "about": "NLM-1 D2/D3.2 ROBUSTNESS set, written by the nlm1 track after AUDIT's second sealed report (categories only, no sealed texts): (A) in-plan multi-step without a planner, (B) cross-turn follow-ups on DIFFERENT boards (2-chart, 4-chart) and DIFFERENT prior turns (one chart vs several; by ticker, by position, by quantifier; ordinals when nothing was created), (C) Undo after removing by \"it\" an indicator that was added to an EXISTING chart by ticker. Final workspace state + Undo, modelTurns 0. `canonical`: the scripted plan a correct planner would return (NLM1_WF_MODE=planner).",
